Error [E2305]: `window` must borrow from its declared `from` sources
  --> tests/ui/view_from_param_escape.jet:9:16
    |
  9 |     use_window(window, packet)
    |                ^^^^^^
 Why: this argument's view owners are outside the sources named after `from`
 Fix: pass a view derived from those sources, or widen the `from` clause
